{"seq":1,"slug":"vs-contrastive-masked","title":"对比学习与掩码建模路线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/paradigm-comparison/vs-contrastive-masked","wordCount":1679,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"对比学习与掩码建模路线\">对比学习与掩码建模路线</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>要判断 JEPA 到底新在哪里，最有效的方法不是读它的主张，而是把它放回自监督学习的家谱里，看清它从每条支线各继承了什么、又拒绝了什么。到 2023 年为止，视觉自监督主要有四条技术路线：靠负样本的对比学习、靠结构不对称的自蒸馏、靠统计约束的冗余消除、以及靠重构损失的掩码建模。JEPA 不在这四条之外凭空出现——它的任务形式来自掩码建模，防坍缩机制来自自蒸馏，而「在表征空间预测未来」的目标函数则能一路追溯到对比时代的 CPC。下图给出谱系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    C[&quot;对比学习&lt;br/&gt;SimCLR / MoCo&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;预测未来的表征&quot;| CPC[&quot;CPC&lt;br/&gt;arXiv 1807.03748&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;自蒸馏&lt;br/&gt;BYOL / DINO&quot;] --&gt;|EMA 与 stop-gradient| J[&quot;JEPA 家族&quot;]&#10;    CPC --&gt; J&#10;    M[&quot;掩码建模&lt;br/&gt;BEiT / MAE&quot;] --&gt;|掩码式任务设计| J&#10;    R[&quot;冗余消除&lt;br/&gt;Barlow Twins / VICReg&quot;] -.-&gt;|方差正则思想| J\">flowchart TD\n    C[\"对比学习&lt;br/&gt;SimCLR / MoCo\"] --&gt;|\"预测未来的表征\"| CPC[\"CPC&lt;br/&gt;arXiv 1807.03748\"]\n    B[\"自蒸馏&lt;br/&gt;BYOL / DINO\"] --&gt;|EMA 与 stop-gradient| J[\"JEPA 家族\"]\n    CPC --&gt; J\n    M[\"掩码建模&lt;br/&gt;BEiT / MAE\"] --&gt;|掩码式任务设计| J\n    R[\"冗余消除&lt;br/&gt;Barlow Twins / VICReg\"] -.-&gt;|方差正则思想| J</pre><h2 id=\"对比学习-负样本的经济学\">对比学习：负样本的经济学</h2><p>对比学习的核心公式是 InfoNCE。对一个正样本对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(z_i, z_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，损失把它们的相似度从一堆负样本中「挤」出来：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = -\\log \\frac{\\exp(\\operatorname{sim}(z_i, z_j)/\\tau)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N} \\exp(\\operatorname{sim}(z_i, z_k)/\\tau)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5979em;vertical-align:-1.1709em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1709em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>SimCLR 证明这条公式有效，但代价是需要大 batch 提供足量负样本；MoCo 用动量队列把负样本库移出 batch，训练才变得经济。对比学习真正的遗产有两条：一是<strong>对齐与均匀性的张力</strong>——正样本要在嵌入空间靠近，同时所有样本要尽量铺开以防坍缩，这个几何直觉贯穿了后来所有联合嵌入方法；二是 CPC 提出的关键转向：<strong>预测未来的表征而不是未来的信号本身</strong>。CPC 用 InfoNCE 训练模型从上下文预测未来时刻的编码，这在结构上已经是潜空间预测，只差一个更丰富的目标侧设计。JEPA 与 CPC 的血缘关系，比它与 MAE 的关系更近。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自蒸馏-无负样本的防坍缩\">自蒸馏：无负样本的防坍缩</h2><p>2020 年 BYOL 展示了一个令人意外的结果：完全去掉负样本，只用在线网络预测慢速目标网络的输出，系统并不坍缩。其机制是预测器与 EMA 目标构成的结构不对称——作弊解虽然存在，但梯度动力学不会停在作弊解上。DINO 把这套机制放大后发现了著名的涌现性质：ViT 自注意图无需标注即可分割物体。JEPA 对这一支的继承是最直接的：stop-gradient 加指数滑动平均的目标编码器，正是 BYOL 的原装部件。区别在于任务——BYOL 预测同一图像另一个增强视图的全局表征，而 JEPA 把「增强视图」换成了「同一样本内的掩码目标块」，让预测具有明确的空间或时间指向性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"掩码建模-重构损失的得与失\">掩码建模：重构损失的得与失</h2><p>第三支线的出发点不同：不设计不变性，而是把遮挡当作代理任务。BEiT 先用离散 tokenizer 把 patch 变成词再预测词元；MAE 则直接在像素域重建被遮块，配合高遮蔽率与非对称编解码结构，把训练做得又快又好。掩码建模学到的特征在稠密预测任务上尤其强，这是纯不变性方法长期以来的短板。</p>\n<p>但像素重构有一个结构性缺陷，<a href=\"../motivation-mechanism/why-not-generative\">LeCun 论纲</a> 对此有过信息论层面的分析：损失函数强迫模型为不可预测的高频细节分配容量，中频语义反而被稀释。iBOT 尝试用在线 tokenizer 缓解，本质上已经是在向表征空间撤退。JEPA 把这最后一步走完——掩码任务的形式保留，重构损失整个替换为表征距离：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>MAE</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⟹</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>JEPA</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{MAE}} = \\lVert \\hat{x} - x \\rVert^2 \\quad \\Longrightarrow \\quad \\mathcal{L}_{\\text{JEPA}} = \\lVert g_\\phi(f_\\theta(x)) - f_{\\bar\\theta}(y) \\rVert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MAE</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">JEPA</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4629em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2371em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)∥</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条替换在视频上尤其划算。视频的重构损失几乎必然被外观细节主导——相邻帧的像素差异大部分来自光照与遮挡边界，而非语义事件；把损失移入表征空间后，时间维度上的「预测」才第一次指向运动与因果结构，而不是帧间插值。V-JEPA 冻结探针在动作分类上的表现，可以看作这一论点的实验注脚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四条路线的正面对照\">四条路线的正面对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>对比学习</th>\n<th>自蒸馏</th>\n<th>掩码建模</th>\n<th>JEPA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>监督信号</td>\n<td>正负样本相似度</td>\n<td>同一样本两视图</td>\n<td>被遮输入的原始信号</td>\n<td>被遮目标的表征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否需要负样本</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>损失所在空间</td>\n<td>嵌入空间</td>\n<td>嵌入空间</td>\n<td>像素/词元空间</td>\n<td>表征空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否重建输入</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型短板</td>\n<td>负样本开销、增强偏置</td>\n<td>理论解释滞后</td>\n<td>容量花在高频细节</td>\n<td>目标侧稳定性调参</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中最后一列解释了 JEPA 的工程气质：它没有引入全新的优化原理，而是把三条成熟支线里经过验证的部件组装到一个「无解码器」的骨架上，把全部风险集中到唯一的新问题——目标侧质量——上。这也是为什么复现时的调参清单那么短：掩码几何、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>、warmup，见 <a href=\"../getting-hands-dirty/open-implementations\">开源实现与复现指南</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"谱系视角的实际用处\">谱系视角的实际用处</h2><p>把谱系弄清楚不只是智力洁癖。第一，它决定了消融实验的设计：想知道某个改进来自哪里，就该沿着对应支线找基线，比如验证 EMA 必要性时对照的是 BYOL 式配置而非 MAE。第二，它预示了融合方向——VICReg 式显式正则与 EMA 结构如今经常混用，苹果团队 2025 年的工作甚至反过来用冻结教师简化整个训练管线，这类混合体正在模糊四条支线的边界。第三，它帮你看懂评测差异：对比方法的探针成绩天然偏向全局分类，掩码方法偏向稠密定位，JEPA 的成绩单则要按任务族分开解读，具体协议见 <a href=\"../getting-hands-dirty/probing-evaluation\">探针评测方法</a>。</p>\n<p>家族内部三代模型如何继承这套谱系，已在 <a href=\"../motivation-mechanism/jepa-family-tree\">JEPA 家族：I-JEPA、V-JEPA 与 V-JEPA 2</a> 中逐代交代；与掩码建模之外的另一大对手——生成式世界模型——的比较则交给 <a href=\"vs-generative-world-models\">生成式世界模型（Genie 类）</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>JEPA 的任务形式承自掩码建模，防坍缩部件承自 BYOL，「预测表征而非信号」的思想可追溯到 CPC；</li>\n<li>它拒绝的是像素域损失与负样本经济，换来的是容量向语义集中和训练吞吐提升；</li>\n<li>四条支线正在互相渗透，看懂谱系才能正确设计消融与解读评测数字。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"对比学习与掩码建模路线","id":"对比学习与掩码建模路线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"对比学习：负样本的经济学","id":"对比学习-负样本的经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"自蒸馏：无负样本的防坍缩","id":"自蒸馏-无负样本的防坍缩"},{"level":2,"text":"掩码建模：重构损失的得与失","id":"掩码建模-重构损失的得与失"},{"level":2,"text":"四条路线的正面对照","id":"四条路线的正面对照"},{"level":2,"text":"谱系视角的实际用处","id":"谱系视角的实际用处"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"JEPA 家族：I-JEPA、V-JEPA 与 V-JEPA 2","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/motivation-mechanism/jepa-family-tree"},"next":{"title":"生成式世界模型（Genie 类）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/paradigm-comparison/vs-generative-world-models"}}